    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Retirement",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S6697\n\n TITLE OF BILL :  An act in relation to granting Tier I status in the\nNew York state and local employees' retirement system to Thomas Amodeo\n\n PURPOSE :\n\nTo grant retroactive membership in the New York State and Local\nretirement system with Tier 1 status.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\n\nTo correct Thomas Amodeo's tier status in the New York State\nRetirement Local System so that it accurately reflects his service\nemployment record by including his employment as supervisor at the\nCity of Buffalo Department of Special Projects which commenced in\n1970.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nThomas Amodeo is currently a member of the New York state Local\nretirement system, Tier 3 who through no fault of his own did not\nbecome a member of the New York Local Retirement System when he was\nemployed by the City of Buffalo as a supervisor in the department of\nSpecial Projects in 1970. Such employment would entitle him to Tier 1\nstatus. This bill is designed to correct that oversight.\n\n PRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\nNew Bill\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nSee fiscal note.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act will take effect immediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
