    "lawSection": "Retirement",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S6697A\n\nSPONSOR: JACOBS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act in relation to granting Tier I status in the New York state and\nlocal employees' retirement system to Thomas Amodeo\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo grant retroactive membership in the New York State and Local retire-\nment system with Tier 1 status.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nTo correct Thomas Amodeo's tier status in the New York State Retirement\nLocal System so that it accurately reflects his service employment\nrecord by including his employment as supervisor at the City of Buffalo\nDepartment of Special Projects which commenced in 1970.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThomas Amodeo is currently a member of the New York state Local retire-\nment system, Tier 3 who through no fault of his own did not become a\nmember of the New York Local Retirement System when he was employed by\nthe City of Buffalo as a supervisor in the department of Special\nProjects in 1970. Such employment would entitle him to Tier 1 status.\nThis bill is designed to correct that oversight.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nSee fiscal note.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
